{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/7a39658a38a70ec09eda8ecfe6d96dcb.avif?t=1770199062\" width=1560 height=389 /></span>Your great aunt Alison has left you her old manor house in the sleepy village on Follyoaks. You have always dreamt of creating your own dinosaur museum and now you finally have the space to do it!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig for fossils</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your exhibits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your museum to visitors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend quirky characters from the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix up your manor to create (and redecorate!) a museum where everyone feels welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fossil Quest is a wholesome game for all ages. It has no time pressure and can be played at whatever pace you are comfortable with.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/3471d8bdb25241a5231c8b011d641e5e.poster.avif?t=1770199062\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/3471d8bdb25241a5231c8b011d641e5e.webm?t=1770199062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/3471d8bdb25241a5231c8b011d641e5e.mp4?t=1770199062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/436259ca52f1762ec510178543c60509.avif?t=1770199062\" width=1560 height=389 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fossil Quest is in its <strong>early stages of development</strong>. We currently have a public, free prototype on Itch where you can play and send us feedback! It currently has 3-4 hours of gameplay.\u00a0<br><br>Please join our discord channel if you want to keep up to date with our progress or ask us any questions! or follow our journey on any of our other social channels. We would not be able to make this game without community support and are so grateful to everyone who has helped us so far!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/e9f608207694935280dcddfbd4e85448.poster.avif?t=1770199062\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/e9f608207694935280dcddfbd4e85448.webm?t=1770199062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/extras/e9f608207694935280dcddfbd4e85448.mp4?t=1770199062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT US</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! This game is being made by small husband and wife team (Lasse &amp; Romy) and is completely independent and self-funded. We hope you will enjoy playing it! Your support means so much to us and we'd love to hear what you think.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105540?t=1770199062","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4105540?t=1770199062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4105540/ddec57503423